      "fine_trace_step": 13,
      "description": "AddressSanitizer crash site. The Intel branch dereferences the second byte of the 16-bit word requested by `exif_mnote_data_apple_load`; on the witnessed `i = 39` iteration that pointer is `original_input + 516`, so `buf[1]` reads address 517, five bytes past the 512-byte heap region."
